    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rindu is a single-player hack-and-slash adventure set inside a surreal dream world.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>In times of need, dreams serve as a gateway\u00a0to our <strong>inner selves.</strong></i> <br><br>You wake in a cold sweat. You are Hope, an 18-year-old girl in search of her father; though as soon as you step out of the house to look for him, you plummet into a shadowy battlefield. It is now your job to fight these nebulous monsters that are a manifestation of your fears, regrets, and traumas through many visually distinct dreamscapes that represent your day-to-day life. You will attempt to regain memory fragments throughout your playthrough to reveal pieces of <i>her</i> past. You must find out what is happening inside your head, and you will fight everything that stands in your way, even <i>yourself</i>. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through many varieties of shadow enemies in a hack-and-slash combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect new abilities every level to take down your opponents.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect with a touching story through character interactions and object descriptions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore unique dream settings, each reflecting a different part of <i>her</i> subconscious.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover who or what is corrupting these dreams.\u2028</p></li></ul>",
